670	 * truncate / drop / rename / optimize / analyze / add-column / drop-column /
671	 * add-index / drop-index. Every one: owner-or-admin, not-impersonating, owned-db,
672	 * rate-limited, TABLE validated by membership. New object names go through
673	 * isSimpleIdent; a new column's type through normalizeColumnType; existing
674	 * columns/indexes through membership against the live structure. No user VALUES
675	 * are ever embedded (there are none in this DDL), and everything runs through the
676	 * scoped `runScopedSql` transport — the MySQL grant remains the hard boundary. */
677	
678	async function ddlPreamble(
679	  accountId: string,
680	  dbName: string,
